OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAHousing site crush death an
OL,4,Aaccident - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest at Nottingham Coroner's
OL,7,FCourt previously heard the 60-year-old,
OL,8,Fwho had worked for KRM Building
OL,9,FSupplies, was found lying on the
OL,10,Fflatbed of the lorry in pain, and said
OL,11,Fthe words "crushed and crane", before
OL,12,Fsuffering a cardiac arrest.
OL,14,FOn Thursday, a jury found he died as a
OL,15,Fresult of pelvic injuries and "crushing
OL,16,Fof the abdomen", with "ischaemic heart
OL,17,Fdisease and myocardial scarring" also a
OL,18,Ffactor.
